---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PhotoCard from '../components/PhotoCard.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Impact"
  description="See the impact Dosis Kardia Foundation has made in the lives of vulnerable, street-connected children in Port Harcourt, Nigeria."
>
  <section class="pt-40 pb-16 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-umber font-semibold">
      The power of giving.
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24 text-ink/75 leading-relaxed space-y-5">
    <p>
      Since the inception of Dosis Kardia Foundation, we have distributed
      food and basic necessities to help meet children's daily needs,
      ensuring that no child goes to bed hungry.
    </p>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <PhotoCard src="/images/impact/gallery-1.jpg" alt="Food distribution to children" aspect="aspect-[4/3]" />
      <PhotoCard src="/images/impact/gallery-2.jpg" alt="Children with learning materials" aspect="aspect-[4/3]" />
    </div>

    <p>
      We have supported access to education by providing learning materials
      and guidance, helping children take their first steps toward a
      brighter future.
    </p>
    <p>
      Through our initiatives, we have also facilitated access to basic
      healthcare, addressing urgent medical needs and promoting overall
      well-being.
    </p>

    <PhotoCard
      src="/images/impact/gallery-3.jpg"
      alt="A child receiving medical care"
      aspect="aspect-[16/7]"
    />

    <div class="bg-marigold/10 border border-marigold/30 rounded-xl p-6 text-sm text-umber/80 not-italic mt-10">
      <strong>Note for the client:</strong> this page is written narratively
      for now, since we don't yet have hard numbers (children reached, meals
      served, dates). Once you share real figures, we can add a stats/counter
      section here — the same count-up animation already used on the
      homepage — for stronger credibility with donors.
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
